tsp-output/

# Gate-generated catalog (reconcile mode). Regenerated on every run of
# typescript/shrapnel/test/catalog_replay_gate.sh, so it is a build artifact,
# not evidence.
#
# Note the deliberate contrast with shrapnel-catalog.sql, which IS committed:
# that file is #591's reproducibility evidence, and compile.e2e asserts a
# recompile is byte-identical to it. The reconcile variant has no such
# contract — it exists only to be applied twice by the replay gate.
shrapnel-catalog-reconcile.sql
